{"words": [{"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "كَصَيِّبٍۢ", "translation": "like a rainstorm"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translation": "the sky"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "in it (are)"}, {"text": "ظُلُمَـٰتٌۭ", "translation": "darkness[es]"}, {"text": "وَرَعْدٌۭ", "translation": "and thunder"}, {"text": "وَبَرْقٌۭ", "translation": "and lightning"}, {"text": "يَجْعَلُونَ", "translation": "They put"}, {"text": "أَصَـٰبِعَهُمْ", "translation": "their fingers"}, {"text": "فِىٓ", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ءَاذَانِهِم", "translation": "their ears"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّوَٰعِقِ", "translation": "the thunderclaps"}, {"text": "حَذَرَ", "translation": "(in) fear (of)"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتِ ۚ", "translation": "[the] death"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "مُحِيطٌۢ", "translation": "(is) [the One Who] encompasses"}, {"text": "بِٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "the disbelievers"}], "sahih": "Or [it is] like a rainstorm from the sky within which is darkness, thunder and lightning. They put their fingers in their ears against the thunderclaps in dread of death. But Allāh is encompassing1 of the disbelievers."}